<title>UK: CE Heath says share repurchase on today.</title>
<headline>CE Heath says share repurchase on today.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance broker C.E. Heath Plc said on Wednesday it had instructed its agent UBS Limited to purchase for cancellation up to 1.0 million shares.</p>
<p>The transactions will be &quot;consistent with its statement of its intention to repurchase shares&quot; made at the time of its interim results last month, Heath said in a statement.</p>
<p>Its shares traded at an unchanged 76 pence in early trade, with no evidence of heavy volume apparent by 1010 GMT.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
